  {
   "uid": "U00072",
   "en": "One week earlier… a young man went missing."
  },
  {
   "uid": "U00073",
   "en": "His name was Takeshi Hongo. The brightest student in the biochemistry lab at Jonan University, he was also a formidable motocross racer."
  },
  {
   "uid": "U00074",
   "en": "His motocross mentor, and the guardian of a young man with no family left in the world, was Tobei Tachibana…"
  },
  {
   "uid": "U00075",
   "en": "While training at motocross with Tachibana, Hongo was attacked by a mysterious biker gang and abducted."
  },
  {
   "uid": "U00076",
   "en": "And so, still unconscious, Hongo was brought to a place far from any town…"
  },
  {
   "uid": "U00077",
   "en": "…Where the hell am I? Let me go!"
  },
  {
   "uid": "U00078",
   "en": "Heh heh heh…<p>Takeshi Hongo… Welcome to our Shocker."
  },
  {
   "uid": "U00079",
   "en": "…Shocker? What are you talking about?"
